      "message": "At least most of these things should be taken care of by the ultimate PE state change, e.g. the AMS and PRS flags and the timers. If they aren\u0027t, we should probably fix up the state entry/exit functions that need to reset them.\n\nSome of these we probably don\u0027t want to clear, e.g. the DR Swap request and VDM wait timers. We do want the FRS to happen before we act on any of these. It looks to me like we already have [code to do that](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/usbc/usb_pe_drp_sm.c;l\u003d894;drc\u003d82bc5d81d5f49328a264ea96503bdc54266426b7). Is this check still happening too late?",
